 'Celtic Garamond the 2nd'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"></span></font></span></font><font color="#d3d3d3"></font></p> <p align="center"><font color="#d3d3d3"></font></p><font color="#d3d3d3"> <p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><img src="/pics/1602/hierarchy/Amya2.JPG" /></span></p> <p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1581"><img src="/pics/1602/hierarchy/LabelAmy.gif" /></a></span></p> <p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">The Queen of Moonlite Redemption<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>is responsible for many things.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>One of her primary responsibilities, is handling many of the “day to day” operations of the guild.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>She aides in the planning, and execution of many of the guild’s raids and events.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p> <p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes"><img src="/pics/1602/hierarchy/DIVIDER.JPG" /></span></span></span></p> <p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Celtic Garamond the 2nd'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><font color="#d3d3d3"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: 'Celtic Garamond the 2nd'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">The Treasurer</span></b></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: 'Celtic Garamond the 2nd'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></b></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt">The Treasurer’s main responsibility is the guild bank.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>He is in charge of all items within the bank.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>It is his responsibility to keep track of what items are in the bank.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>He also handles the item bidding on the guild website.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>It is his responsibility to keep the Guild Bank page on the website accurate.&nbsp; There is&nbsp;1 treasurer.</span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span></span>&nbsp;</p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><img src="/pics/1602/hierarchy/Uanelil.JPG" /></span>&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><img src="/pics/1602/hierarchy/LabelUan.gif" /></span></p><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span>&nbsp;</p><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: 'Celtic Garamond the 2nd'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><strong> <hr id="null" /> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"></strong>&nbsp;</p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><o:p></o:p><strong>The Advisors</strong></span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">The royal advisor has the difficult job of making suggestions to the queen, and helping her run the guild in a smooth manner, even when problems arise.&nbsp; This job is not as easy as it sounds, but the current advisor has over 5 years of extensive experience to draw from.&nbsp; A true asset!&nbsp; There may be up to 2 advisors.</span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik"><font size="3"></font></span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik"></span><span style="COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik"></span>&nbsp;</p> <p align="center"><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v511/Amyana/Hierachy/Miskewen.gif" /> </p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik"><font size="3"></font></span>&nbsp;</p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"></span><span style="COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik"><font size="3"> <hr id="null" /> <o:p></o:p></font></span> <p></p> <p></p> <p></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: 'Celtic Garamond the 2nd'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">The Liaison<o:p></o:p></span></b></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></span>&nbsp;</p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-bidi-font-size: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">The Liaison is the main communicator between Moonlite Redemption and other guilds in official capacity.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>The Liaison reports relevant information to the guild.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes">&nbsp; </span>The Liaison is the guild’s representative.&nbsp; There may be up to 2 liaisons.<o:p></o:p></span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik"><font size="3"> <hr id="null" /> <o:p></o:p></font></span> <p></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: Magik; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: 'Celtic Garamond the 2nd'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">The Commander<o:p></o:p></span></b></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: lightgrey; FONT-FAMILY: 'Celtic Garamond the 2nd'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></b></p> <p style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="